  "mach:judgement": "Adopt",
  "mach:judgementReason": "Production-proven FHIR R5-native HMIS operating at national scale in India — 580+ hospitals, 10+ states, 186 million people served. Designated the 50th Digital Public Good by the DPGA, ABDM-compliant, and backed by the Michael & Susan Dell Foundation and ACT Grants. MIT-licensed with active development (v3.0.0, 5000+ commits, 47 releases). The reference open-source EHR for LMIC and national-scale health system deployments, particularly where Tele-ICU and resource analytics are priorities.",
